  "data": {
    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Court of the Archon",
    "summary": "When your Shooting phase begins, or when the Fight phase begins, you may Empower this unit; doing so costs 1 Pain token. While it is Empowered, this unit gains benefits based on what it contains: with 1 or more Lhamaean models, its models' melee weapons gain [LETHAL HITS]; with 1 or more Medusae models, its models' ranged weapons gain [IGNORES COVER]; with 1 or more Sslyth models, melee attacks aimed at it take -1 on the Wound roll; with 1 or more Ur-ghul models, it has Fights First.",
